<title>CHINA: YANGTZEKIANG YEARLY NET JUMPS 118 PCT.</title>
<headline>YANGTZEKIANG YEARLY NET JUMPS 118 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   4.9    vs 2.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.0    vs 1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs 7.45 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    6.88   vs 3.16</p>
<p>    Turnover		     889.58 vs 769.62</p>
<p>    Company name		 Yangtzekiang Garment Manufacturing</p>
<p>				     Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 22-29</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 6</p>
<p>NOTE - Yangtzekiang Garment makes garments and textiles.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is two H.K. cents vs two cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
